`_updateBorrowAndCollateralShare` is called by `_liquidateUser` method which is called by other methods till we reach `liquidate`. Here is the flow:

 `liquidate` => `_closedLiquidation` => `_liquidateUser` => `_updateBorrowAndCollateralShare`

The liquidater can pass `maxBorrowAmount` when calling `liquidate` . This will be passed to  `_updateBorrowAndCollateralShare`. This method  **chooses maxBorrowPart if it is smaller than availableBorrowPart** 
```solidity
	borrowPart = maxBorrowPart > availableBorrowPart
