AaveStrategy.sol is not protected against tokens with a Loan-to-Value (LTV) of 0.
LTVs of assets could be set to 0, even though they currently aren't, it could create substantial problems with potential disruption of multiple functionalities. This bug could cause a Denial-of-Service (DoS) situation in some cases.

