                    claimed[_tokenId][claimableIndex] += amount;
                    rewardTokens[claimableIndex].safeTransfer(_to, amount);
                }
                ++i;
            }
        }
    }
```

From the above code we know that the amount of `tokens` is obtained as:` uint256 amount = amounts[i];`

The `i` is the index of the `_rewardTokens` array passed in by the user, not the `rewardTokens` index.
The correct index of the token should be the variable `claimableIndex`.
So the amount should be: `uint256 amount = amounts[claimableIndex];`

The result is that the user makes a profit by swapping amounts of valuable tokens with worthless tokens.

