## Proof of Concept
Suppose Alice has deposited 1000 USDO on BNB Chain. She wants to withdraw the 1000 USDO but she has no BNB token, so she initiates the request on Optimism by calling function `removeAsset` at contract BaseUSDO to send a cross chain request. However, she mistakenly inputs 1200 USDO as withdrawl amount, so the transaction fails.
Suddenly, Alice changes her mind. She decides to deposit more USDO on BNB chain (don't ask me why). Then Alice calls `sendAndLendOrRepay` instead and successfully deposits another 800 USDO on BNB Chain.
However, Bad guy Bob has detected Alice's transactions. He retries Alice's first `removeAsset` and it will now succeed (1800>1200), although Alice does not want to `removeAsset` at this moment.

